  "body": "Ideally we provide some advice on which hook to use when. I'd say you should use \"UTF-8 decode\" for a full resource, \"UTF-8 decode without BOM\" for byte sequences within a larger resource or protocol, and \"UTF-8 encode\" on the other side.\r\n\r\nIf you use \"decode\", \"UTF-8 decode without BOM or fail\", or \"encode\" you should ideally first file an issue here to get approval.\r\n\r\ncc @hsivonen @aphillips ",
